{
  "slug": "claude-universe",
  "name": "Claude Universe",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Five intelligence systems for Claude Code. Analyze instruction quality, generate deeper tests, scan for security vulnerabilities, understand codebase architecture, and trace how your code evolves over time.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **20 skills**, **6 agents** and **6 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (20): `check-rules` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"check adherence\", \"check rule adherence\", \"are my rules…), `discover` (Use when the user wants to infer reusable project conventions from existing code and turn them into instruction…), `dissect` (This skill should be used when the user asks \"when did this get complicated\", \"why is this file…), `drift` (This skill should be used when the user asks \"has this module drifted\", \"is this code still doing…), `explain` (Use when the user wants a deep explanation of a specific file, module, or implementation flow: \"explain this…), `forecast` (This skill should be used when the user asks \"what's about to become a problem\", \"predict issues\", \"trend…), `hotspots` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"find hotspots\", \"what are the riskiest files\", \"where…), `impact` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"check the impact\", \"what will break if I…), and 12 more\n- **Agents** (6): `codebase-analyst` (Autonomous agent that performs a comprehensive codebase analysis), `evolution-analyst` (Autonomous agent that analyzes the temporal health of a codebase), `instruction-advisor` (Autonomous agent that performs comprehensive instruction file analysis), `orbit-orchestrator` (Autonomous orchestrator for /orbit Standard mode), `security-auditor` (Autonomous agent that performs a comprehensive security audit of the entire project), `test-auditor` (Autonomous agent that audits test quality across an entire project)\n- **MCP servers** (6): `alignkit-local`, `testkit`, `shieldkit`, `lenskit`, `timewarp`, `alignkit`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-universe@claude-community` from `mbwsims/claude-universe`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 20,
    "agent": 6,
    "mcp": 6
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
